### 1. Список всех книг
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books

### 2. Фильтр + лимит
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?author=Bloch&limit=1

### 3. Одна книга
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### 4. Несуществующая книга
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/999

### 5. Создание книги
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Pro Spring 6","author":"Cosmina","year":2023}

### 6. Замена книги с id=1
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Effective Java 4th","author":"Joshua Bloch","year":2024}

### 7. Удаление id=2
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/2

### 8. Повторное удаление id=2
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/2